# Per-project build env for the demo fork's sidecar.
#
# Read by `sidecar/deploy.sh` before `bun build`. Bun bakes
# `process.env.INCLUDE_SIM_MODE` into the compiled binary at build time, so
# this MUST be set during the build (not just at runtime). Mirrors the
# matching files in web/apphosting.yaml + functions/.env.patient-demo-project.
#
# Installer-emitted customer forks omit this file; the binary ships with
# `INCLUDE_SIM_MODE=false` so sim-mode short-circuits before any
# Firestore lookup, and `simulation/native/*` paths are unreachable.

INCLUDE_SIM_MODE=true
